      "url": "https://ab-orbit.github.io/css3e/articles/ethics-on-ai/ai-ethics-empirical-study/index.html",
      "name": "AI Ethics: An Empirical Study on the Views of Practitioners and Lawmakers",
      "headline": "Ética de IA: O Que Pensam Profissionais e Legisladores",
      "inLanguage": "pt-BR",
      "author": [
        {
          "@type": "Person",
